{"seq":1,"slug":"category-theory-in-cs","title":"范畴论与计算机科学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/category-theory/applications/category-theory-in-cs","wordCount":1324,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"范畴论与计算机科学\">范畴论与计算机科学</h1><p>1980 年代，当数学家还在争论范畴论是不是「抽象废话」时，计算机科学家发现它出奇地实用：类型化 lambda 演算的模型恰好是某类范畴，递归数据结构恰好是某个函子的不动点，数据库的模式迁移恰好是函子。范畴论之所以在 CS 里扎根，是因为编程的核心活动——组合——正是范畴的复合，而范畴论早把组合研究透了。本篇是应用章的地图，划清三条支线（语义、数据类型、数据库）各归哪一篇深讲，自己专注「为什么对应成立」的总论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把编程对象翻译成范畴论对象，是这条联系的起点。最基本的字典是：类型当对象，程序（函数）当态射，函数复合当态射复合，恒等函数当恒等态射。一个编程语言的类型系统于是构成一个范畴，记作该语言的句法范畴。</p>\n<p>这个翻译立刻带来约束的对应。下表给出最核心的几条：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编程概念</th>\n<th>范畴论对象</th>\n<th>出处篇目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类型</td>\n<td>对象</td>\n<td><a href=\"../foundations/categories-objects-morphisms\">范畴：对象与态射</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>态射</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>积类型（元组/记录）</td>\n<td>积</td>\n<td><a href=\"../universal-constructions/products-coproducts\">积与余积</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>和类型（枚举/联合）</td>\n<td>余积</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位类型 <code>unit</code></td>\n<td>终对象</td>\n<td><a href=\"../universal-constructions/limits-colimits\">极限与余极限</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空类型 <code>void</code></td>\n<td>始对象</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数类型 <code>A -&gt; B</code></td>\n<td>指数对象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B^A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>本篇</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泛型 / 容器</td>\n<td>函子</td>\n<td><a href=\"../foundations/functors\">函子</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表不是类比，是同构：积类型满足的泛性质就是范畴积的泛性质，一字不差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"笛卡尔闭范畴与-curry-howard-lambek\">笛卡尔闭范畴与 Curry–Howard–Lambek</h2><p>类型系统真正成熟的标志是有了高阶函数，对应范畴论里的「指数对象」。一个范畴若有终对象、所有二元积、以及所有指数对象，就称为笛卡尔闭范畴（CCC）。指数对象 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B^A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由柯里化的泛性质定义——它正是 <a href=\"../core-theorems/adjunctions\">伴随</a> 里「积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-)\\times A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 左伴随于指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>A</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(-)^A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0913em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」那条伴随的对象层面体现。</p>\n<p>CCC 的意义由 Lambek 与 Lawvere 在 1980 年代点明：简单类型 lambda 演算与笛卡尔闭范畴本质等价。这把著名的 Curry–Howard 对应（证明即程序）补全成三位一体：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  L[&quot;直觉主义逻辑&lt;br/&gt;命题 / 证明&quot;] &lt;--&gt;|&quot;Curry-Howard&quot;| P[&quot;类型化 lambda 演算&lt;br/&gt;类型 / 程序&quot;]&#10;  P &lt;--&gt;|&quot;Lambek&quot;| C[&quot;笛卡尔闭范畴&lt;br/&gt;对象 / 态射&quot;]&#10;  C &lt;--&gt;|&quot;闭环&quot;| L\">graph TD\n  L[\"直觉主义逻辑&lt;br/&gt;命题 / 证明\"] &lt;--&gt;|\"Curry-Howard\"| P[\"类型化 lambda 演算&lt;br/&gt;类型 / 程序\"]\n  P &lt;--&gt;|\"Lambek\"| C[\"笛卡尔闭范畴&lt;br/&gt;对象 / 态射\"]\n  C &lt;--&gt;|\"闭环\"| L</pre><p>命题、类型、对象是同一件事；证明、程序、态射是同一件事。逻辑学家证一个定理、程序员写一个函数、范畴论者构造一个态射，三者在做同样的工作。这是 20 世纪计算机科学最深刻的统一之一，其逻辑一侧的完整展开在 <a href=\"categorical-logic-topos\">范畴逻辑与拓扑斯</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"f-代数与递归数据类型\">F-代数与递归数据类型</h2><p>递归数据类型（自然数、列表、树）在范畴论里有一个干净的解释：它们是某个函子的初始代数。给定自函子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>-代数是态射 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(A)\\to A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>；初始 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>-代数就是这些代数构成范畴里的始对象。</p>\n<p>以自然数为例，取函子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(X)=1+X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>（「要么是零，要么是某数的后继」），它的初始代数恰好是自然数类型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，结构映射打包了 <code>zero</code> 与 <code>succ</code>。初始性直接给出递归原理：从初始代数到任何其它 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>-代数存在唯一态射，这个唯一态射就是 <code>fold</code>（catamorphism）。对偶地，终 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>-余代数给出无穷流这类余递归结构与 <code>unfold</code>。这套「数据类型即函子不动点」的理论是 <a href=\"functional-programming-connection\">与函数式编程的联系</a> 里 fold/unfold 抽象的根据，本篇只点到，深讲留给那篇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据库-并发与更广的版图\">数据库、并发与更广的版图</h2><p>范畴论在 CS 的触角远不止类型系统。David Spivak 等人用函子把数据库模式建模为范畴，模式迁移即函子，数据完整性约束即交换图，这套「函数式数据迁移」理论成了应用范畴论（Applied Category Theory）社区的招牌课题。并发与分布式系统里，Petri 网与进程演算被赋予幺半范畴语义；量子计算里，ZX-演算用幺半范畴的图形语言重写线路。</p>\n<p>到 2026 年，这条联系还在形式化验证里加速：Lean 4 的 Mathlib 已把范畴、函子、自然变换、极限、伴随、单子与米田引理悉数形式化（mathlib 累计逾 11 万定义、23 万定理），category-theory 库被完整移植到 Lean 4，使得「用范畴论指导的程序」可以被机器证明正确（见 arXiv:2501.18639 对 Lean 4 的综述与 arXiv:2512.24796 的 LeanCat 范畴论基准）。范畴论在 CS 里不再是装饰，而是可执行、可验证的基础设施。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>字典：类型↔对象、函数↔态射、积/和类型↔积/余积、<code>unit</code>/<code>void</code>↔终/始对象、<code>A-&gt;B</code>↔指数对象。</li>\n<li>笛卡尔闭范畴 = 终对象 + 积 + 指数；指数来自「积左伴随于指数」的柯里化伴随。</li>\n<li>Curry–Howard–Lambek 三位一体：命题/证明 = 类型/程序 = 对象/态射。</li>\n<li>递归数据类型是函子的初始代数，初始性即 fold；对偶给出 unfold。</li>\n<li>应用扩展到数据库（函子化模式迁移）、并发、量子；2026 年 Lean 4/Mathlib 已形式化全部核心。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>工程细节（Functor/Monad 类型类、do-notation）：<a href=\"functional-programming-connection\">与函数式编程的联系</a></li>\n<li>逻辑一侧的完整展开：<a href=\"categorical-logic-topos\">范畴逻辑与拓扑斯</a></li>\n<li>柯里化的伴随本质：<a href=\"../core-theorems/adjunctions\">伴随</a></li>\n<li>CS 里类型系统的独立讲解：<a href=\"../../../languages/type-systems/type-system-foundations/role-of-type-systems\">类型系统的角色</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"范畴论与计算机科学","id":"范畴论与计算机科学"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"笛卡尔闭范畴与 Curry–Howard–Lambek","id":"笛卡尔闭范畴与-curry-howard-lambek"},{"level":2,"text":"F-代数与递归数据类型","id":"f-代数与递归数据类型"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库、并发与更广的版图","id":"数据库-并发与更广的版图"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"单子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/category-theory/core-theorems/monads"},"next":{"title":"与函数式编程的联系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/category-theory/applications/functional-programming-connection"}}